an5.99:1.4 starts: Having looked all around the four directions,
an5.99:1.5 starts: Having roared his lion’s roar three times,
an5.99:2.6 starts: to female lay followers, he teaches the Dhamma
an6.12:6.2 starts: This, too, is a condition that is
an6.13:3.7 starts: for this is the escape from resentment: